00:52:50.949 --> 00:52:52.883
Don't rush your death.

00:52:52.883 --> 00:52:54.149
Hey, just keep your mouth shut.

00:52:54.149 --> 00:52:55.216
Knife! Knife! Knife!

00:52:55.216 --> 00:52:57.583
Please save me.

00:52:57.583 --> 00:52:59.483
Please save me!

00:53:00.449 --> 00:53:03.160
- Team Leader! - There's a girl over there.

00:53:03.160 --> 00:53:05.783
Go tie her up. Tie up everyone over there and here.

00:53:08.601 --> 00:53:10.220
You're going to regret this.

00:53:10.220 --> 00:53:11.240
We'll regret it?

00:53:11.240 --> 00:53:12.240
Team Leader?

00:53:12.240 --> 00:53:14.283
Put that down.

00:53:19.910 --> 00:53:22.312
<i>Your call cannot be connected and is being forwarded to voicemail.</i>

00:53:22.312 --> 00:53:23.724
<i>After the beep...</i>

00:53:26.000 --> 00:53:28.842
What should we do? Mommy keeps not answering her phone.

00:53:28.842 --> 00:53:32.156
I miss mommy.

00:53:32.156 --> 00:53:33.893
You miss mommy?

00:53:33.893 --> 00:53:37.268
I miss Mommy a lot too.

00:53:37.268 --> 00:53:39.420
Why isn't Mommy answering?

00:53:39.420 --> 00:53:42.916
Mommy is deep in the woods right now.

00:53:42.916 --> 00:53:44.790
So the phone signal isn't good there.

00:53:44.790 --> 00:53:46.000
In the woods?

00:53:46.000 --> 00:53:51.541
Then what if Mommy meets a wolf like Little Red Riding Hood?

00:53:51.541 --> 00:53:53.241
What?

00:53:54.681 --> 00:53:56.349
Is it here?

00:53:56.349 --> 00:53:58.683
It's locked. What do we do?

00:54:06.543 --> 00:54:08.243
Wow...

00:54:29.536 --> 00:54:32.216
Assistant Manager Ki, are you in there?

00:54:33.684 --> 00:54:35.384
Hey!

00:54:42.928 --> 00:54:45.049
Here, here!

00:54:48.249 --> 00:54:50.903
Hurry, hurry.

00:54:50.903 --> 00:54:54.516
What a surprise. Our Assistant Manager Ki has gone missing in action again?

00:54:57.816 --> 00:54:59.964
You really never disappoint.

00:54:59.964 --> 00:55:03.716
Isn't it proper to be surprised and worried at a time like this?

00:55:03.716 --> 00:55:06.383
Oh, my, what do we do? Are you okay?

00:55:07.190 --> 00:55:09.116
Do you two not get along?

00:55:10.049 --> 00:55:13.080
Well, how awful.

00:55:13.080 --> 00:55:14.080
What's it like in there?

00:55:14.080 --> 00:55:15.952
They've already stormed in.

00:55:15.952 --> 00:55:17.149
There are quite a few of them.

00:55:17.149 --> 00:55:18.358
Looks like they planned this.

00:55:18.358 --> 00:55:20.036
Shouldn't we hurry and go?

00:55:20.036 --> 00:55:21.883
They've probably already started fighting.

00:55:21.883 --> 00:55:23.583
Yeah.

00:55:24.480 --> 00:55:26.180
Yeah.

00:55:27.931 --> 00:55:30.975
Team Leader!

00:55:30.975 --> 00:55:33.916
- I won't let you go, you punks. - Ouch!

00:55:36.596 --> 00:55:38.593
Can't we touch them? Why?

00:55:38.593 --> 00:55:40.141
They're gray.

00:55:40.141 --> 00:55:43.783
- What? - They're not approved for a meeting yet.

00:55:43.783 --> 00:55:45.906
Gray means they're still under investigation, not confirmed clients.

00:55:45.906 --> 00:55:47.524
Don't you know that?

00:55:47.524 --> 00:55:49.636
I know that much.

00:55:49.636 --> 00:55:51.983
But they attacked us first!

00:55:51.983 --> 00:55:57.383
Under no circumstances do we conduct a meeting with a non-client.

00:55:57.383 --> 00:55:59.465
We only deal with targets

00:55:59.465 --> 00:56:02.072
That have been verified multiple times

00:56:02.072 --> 00:56:05.916
And finally approved through the system.

00:56:05.916 --> 00:56:08.049
That's our rule.

00:56:09.340 --> 00:56:10.749
So we're just supposed to sit here and take it?

00:56:10.749 --> 00:56:12.665
There are other people in there too.

00:56:12.665 --> 00:56:15.916
Don't worry so much. I said it's not yet.

00:56:17.113 --> 00:56:18.849
Tie them up tight.

00:56:18.849 --> 00:56:21.216
Hurry up.

00:56:21.216 --> 00:56:23.316
Do it properly.

00:56:27.460 --> 00:56:29.783
Team Leader, are you okay?

00:56:31.213 --> 00:56:33.564
I'm fine.

00:56:33.564 --> 00:56:37.248
They wouldn't actually kill us, would they?

00:56:37.248 --> 00:56:38.248
We will.

00:56:38.248 --> 00:56:40.424
Oh, yeah?

00:56:40.424 --> 00:56:41.516
And how are you planning to do that?

00:56:41.516 --> 00:56:43.796
How would you like to die?

00:56:43.796 --> 00:56:45.716
Should I specially cut your belly open while you're alive?

00:56:45.716 --> 00:56:46.783
Come on.

00:56:46.783 --> 00:56:48.580
- Oh. - No.

00:56:48.580 --> 00:56:51.783
Since your eyes are so sparkly, I should gouge those out first.

00:56:51.783 --> 00:56:53.349
They still look like they're worth something.

00:56:53.349 --> 00:56:57.100
That's right. I've got the best eyesight.

00:56:57.100 --> 00:56:58.864
I've eaten a lot of lettuce.

00:56:58.864 --> 00:57:00.816
Beta-carotene, you know.

00:57:01.628 --> 00:57:03.436
B-B-Beta what?

00:57:03.436 --> 00:57:06.083
Beta-carotene, you moron.

00:57:07.049 --> 00:57:08.916
Why are you even entertaining his nonsense?

00:57:08.916 --> 00:57:11.208
Stop the nonsense and move them to the warehouse quickly.

00:57:11.208 --> 00:57:15.440
And call Dr. Jo to come in early in the morning!

00:57:15.440 --> 00:57:17.783
Contact all the clients.

00:57:19.581 --> 00:57:22.071
They'll love this.

00:57:22.071 --> 00:57:25.249
They're all young and healthy.

00:57:26.328 --> 00:57:28.580
I think we're really going to die. What do we do?

00:57:28.580 --> 00:57:30.391
Oh, don't worry.

00:57:30.391 --> 00:57:34.752
My fortune says I'll live to 150.

00:57:34.752 --> 00:57:36.256
You're full of it.

00:57:36.256 --> 00:57:39.728
Hey, you punk, what have you been staring at so intently?

00:57:39.728 --> 00:57:41.900
The phone, idiot. That phone.

00:57:41.900 --> 00:57:44.816
The phone doesn't even work. Darn it!

00:57:47.549 --> 00:57:49.249
What?

00:57:50.632 --> 00:57:51.758
Huh? What is it?

00:57:57.780 --> 00:58:00.183
[Emergency Notice] "Pre-meeting with the client approved"?

00:58:00.183 --> 00:58:01.183
What is this?

00:58:01.183 --> 00:58:03.383
Looks like we finally got approval.

00:58:08.616 --> 00:58:12.616
Alright, let's slowly start our meeting.

00:58:17.272 --> 00:58:20.216
It's done. We've arrived.

00:58:20.216 --> 00:58:21.915
Found it.

00:58:21.915 --> 00:58:23.288
<i>I've sent the evidence.</i>

00:58:23.288 --> 00:58:25.336
<i>Requesting emergency meeting approval.</i>

00:58:25.336 --> 00:58:26.516
So what do we do now?

00:58:26.516 --> 00:58:30.181
They're heavily armed. What if it comes down to hand-to-hand combat?

00:58:30.181 --> 00:58:32.016
You're worrying for nothing again.

00:58:37.148 --> 00:58:40.244
<i>Team leader served in the Army Special Forces.</i>

00:58:40.244 --> 00:58:42.983
<i>He's especially skilled in close-quarters combat.</i>

00:58:44.864 --> 00:58:46.928
Oh, my.

00:58:46.928 --> 00:58:49.364
<i>Assistant Manager Yang's hobby is every combat sport imaginable.</i>

00:58:49.364 --> 00:58:52.416
<i>Judo, taekwondo, kickboxing...</i>

00:58:52.416 --> 00:58:54.516
<i>There's nothing she can't do.</i>

00:59:00.520 --> 00:59:02.220
Jeez.

00:59:05.492 --> 00:59:08.383
You are all bark and no bite.

00:59:09.960 --> 00:59:11.856
Director!

00:59:11.856 --> 00:59:13.556
Director!

00:59:19.292 --> 00:59:22.149
Hands up, you punk!

00:59:23.872 --> 00:59:25.572
Oh, dear.

00:59:26.806 --> 00:59:29.049
An elderly person like you...

00:59:29.698 --> 00:59:34.749
Shouldn't be playing with dangerous things like this.

00:59:35.643 --> 00:59:37.679
Oh, that's hot!

00:59:37.679 --> 00:59:41.949
Shut up! Face the wall, and put your hands up.

00:59:43.718 --> 00:59:45.483
Hurry!

00:59:50.399 --> 00:59:52.099
The rest of you too!

00:59:54.676 --> 00:59:57.049
Hey, move them against the wall!

00:59:59.564 --> 01:00:00.716
Team Leader!

01:00:00.716 --> 01:00:03.483
Hey, step on him.

01:00:06.516 --> 01:00:08.875
Hey, hey!

01:00:08.875 --> 01:00:11.449
If possible, don't touch the stomach area.

01:00:11.449 --> 01:00:14.683
- It's 300 million won each! - Yes!

01:00:20.612 --> 01:00:24.764
<i>Then what if a wolf shows up while Mommy's in the woods?</i>

01:00:24.764 --> 01:00:27.058
The wolf would be too scared and run away.

01:00:27.058 --> 01:00:29.352
Mommy's stronger than the wolf?

01:00:29.352 --> 01:00:33.483
Of course, Mommy is much stronger. Mommy's super strong.

01:00:33.483 --> 01:00:37.936
She can climb the roughest mountain trails like it's nothing.

01:00:37.936 --> 01:00:42.946
Even through deep snow, she plows a path like a bulldozer.

01:00:42.946 --> 01:00:46.684
She's so strong that she can lift me with ease.

01:00:46.684 --> 01:00:50.649
Well... And...

01:00:52.772 --> 01:00:56.149
She's really fearless...

01:01:00.700 --> 01:01:02.637
The Mommy I know

01:01:02.637 --> 01:01:07.244
Is a wonderful person who is rough and strong,

01:01:07.244 --> 01:01:09.449
Yet never loses her grace.

01:01:10.516 --> 01:01:12.320
What is it?

01:01:12.320 --> 01:01:14.783
Why's it so darn noisy?

01:01:16.168 --> 01:01:18.149
Well.

01:01:21.796 --> 01:01:23.772
Director Yoo is awake.

01:01:23.772 --> 01:01:25.092
Director Yoo.

01:01:25.092 --> 01:01:27.940
Oh, darn it, who is it? You noisy punks.

01:01:27.940 --> 01:01:29.856
I can't sleep.

01:01:29.856 --> 01:01:31.452
What's this? Who did this?

01:01:31.452 --> 01:01:33.283
Who tied me up like this?

01:01:33.283 --> 01:01:37.398
- Was it you? - What's with that woman?

01:01:37.398 --> 01:01:41.083
Where did all these darn flies come from?

01:01:41.083 --> 01:01:42.449
What? Flies?

01:01:42.449 --> 01:01:44.783
Flies? You crazy punk!

01:01:49.716 --> 01:01:52.649
You said you could handle it alone. Did you get old already? Huh?

01:01:52.649 --> 01:01:55.224
Well, I've been at it for months.

01:01:55.224 --> 01:01:57.616
I figured I'd at least try doing it myself.

01:01:57.616 --> 01:02:00.141
It was your first outing in a while.

01:02:00.141 --> 01:02:04.108
I wanted you to drink, sleep well, and enjoy yourself.

01:02:04.108 --> 01:02:09.152
Then this old geezer suddenly showed up with a gun.

01:02:09.152 --> 01:02:10.380
- A gun? - Yeah.

01:02:10.380 --> 01:02:12.349
He's got a gun?

01:02:13.408 --> 01:02:16.096
Director Yoo, take care of this.

01:02:16.096 --> 01:02:18.816
Move, you punks.

01:02:21.172 --> 01:02:23.107
Hey!

01:02:23.107 --> 01:02:24.800
You, kneel.

01:02:24.800 --> 01:02:26.456
Yeah, kneel.

01:02:26.456 --> 01:02:27.749
Get on your knees, you punk!

01:02:27.749 --> 01:02:30.716
Where'd this old fly come buzzing from?

01:02:31.808 --> 01:02:33.635
That punk...

01:02:33.635 --> 01:02:36.349
You want a hole in your head?

01:02:37.448 --> 01:02:39.107
"A hole in your head"?

01:02:39.107 --> 01:02:40.807
That's my line.

01:02:42.107 --> 01:02:43.860
Oh, jeez, I...

01:02:43.860 --> 01:02:48.211
Don't move! Move, and I'll shoot!

01:02:48.211 --> 01:02:50.316
If I move, you won't be able to hit me.

01:02:51.716 --> 01:02:55.864
Seriously... Has she lost her mind?

01:02:55.864 --> 01:02:58.483
Go ahead. I'm staying still here.

01:03:01.983 --> 01:03:03.764
T-T-That's right.

01:03:03.764 --> 01:03:05.749
Die, you punk!

01:03:07.849 --> 01:03:10.183
Old man!

01:03:10.183 --> 01:03:13.649
- Old man. - You couldn't even shoot me?

01:03:16.691 --> 01:03:18.516
I won't shoot. I won't.

01:03:18.516 --> 01:03:20.216
You won't shoot?

01:03:27.016 --> 01:03:28.186
Time to go.

01:03:28.186 --> 01:03:29.972
Hey! Kill that punk!

01:03:29.972 --> 01:03:31.552
Shall I go for it after a long time?

01:03:31.552 --> 01:03:33.416
Come at me all at once, you flies!

01:03:33.416 --> 01:03:35.416
Hey! Kill that punk!

01:03:38.449 --> 01:03:40.703
Missed.

01:03:40.703 --> 01:03:42.483
Guess I'll just go then.

01:03:43.449 --> 01:03:45.216
Hey, you punk!

01:04:07.404 --> 01:04:09.716
Yoo Bo Na's drunk habit is out.

01:04:12.068 --> 01:04:13.768
Bo Na...

01:04:24.328 --> 01:04:26.749
Why do you keep getting up?

01:04:40.475 --> 01:04:42.749
<i>A woman as agile as a puma,</i>

01:04:42.749 --> 01:04:44.874
<i>as mighty as a lion,</i>

01:04:44.874 --> 01:04:47.464
<i>and as graceful as a swan.</i>

01:04:47.464 --> 01:04:49.416
<i>Yoo Bo Na looked</i>

01:04:50.272 --> 01:04:52.649
Truly beautiful then.

01:05:27.549 --> 01:05:29.449
Get on your knees, you punk!

01:05:36.049 --> 01:05:38.783
Director Yoo's still got it!

01:06:14.562 --> 01:06:17.719
Yul, I told you I have to go to work today, so I can't, right?

01:06:17.719 --> 01:06:18.724
I hate you, Mommy.

01:06:18.724 --> 01:06:20.640
So this guy is getting out after all?

01:06:20.640 --> 01:06:22.664
But we should move up the timeline.

01:06:22.664 --> 01:06:24.211
Before he returns to his neighborhood.

01:06:24.211 --> 01:06:25.832
That'll cause quite a stir.

01:06:25.832 --> 01:06:27.868
He died the day he was released.

01:06:27.868 --> 01:06:30.249
What if we followed the crimes before they happen?

01:06:30.249 --> 01:06:32.464
Sir, welcome.

01:06:32.464 --> 01:06:34.052
Kingfisher's next target.

01:06:34.052 --> 01:06:35.483
Is this connected to Kingfisher?

01:06:35.483 --> 01:06:37.716
Were you following me?

01:06:37.716 --> 01:06:39.068
What's going on? Team Leader!

01:06:39.068 --> 01:06:41.849
I'm Pyo Kyu Cheol, you punks!

01:06:41.849 --> 01:06:44.860
That puts Director Yoo in the most dangerous position.

01:06:44.860 --> 01:06:47.416
She's also the most likely to get caught.

